  "description": {
   "en": "Volume 2 of ***The Mushiya Series***\n\nNozomi has feelings for Fujimori-senpai, however, he is popular with many female students, and has a girlfriend named Shouko. One night, a \"wish bug\" appears in her room, the wish bug says it will grant three wishes, and Nozomi wishes to be with Fujimori-senpai for just one day...\n\nKaburagi Saiko's blood splattered horror will shock even the strongest soul!"
  },
